WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.728
Some things are for one person, not the whole group. This is the direct message.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.048
Open the Chat tab of a Popkin. Everyone comes first, in the Popkin's colour, with

00:00:13.048 --> 00:00:16.215
its latest message, its time and three unread.

00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:21.378
Under Direct messages, your chats with one member each, the most recent first.

00:00:21.378 --> 00:00:24.605
Walt's is unread: his name in bold, and a dot.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.506
New message lists the Popkin's other members, with a search.

00:00:29.706 --> 00:00:35.070
It ignores case and accents: tomas finds Tomás, and Bren in capitals finds both

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:36.864
Brennans. Choose Walt.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.125
The direct message opens: Walt's avatar and name, and From Lakeside Weekend.

00:00:45.325 --> 00:00:48.816
The thread starts with one line: Only you two can see this.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.384
You write: Deal. See you at eight. Only Walt can read it.

00:00:53.584 --> 00:00:56.398
His answer arrives at once, without reloading.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.685
On a phone and a tablet, the direct message fills the screen.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.634
From ten twenty-four pixels, the list sits beside the thread.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.297
And from twelve eighty, a pane about Walt, with Call Walt.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.558
Call Walt, at the top of the thread, opens a call between the two of you, and nobody

00:01:24.558 --> 00:01:25.129
else.

00:01:25.329 --> 00:01:29.897
Just you, until he answers, with the same controls: Mute, Camera and Leave.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.342
When one of you calls, the other sees it in the direct message: Call, one on the

00:01:36.342 --> 00:01:37.456
call, and Join.

00:01:37.656 --> 00:01:42.121
Join, and it is just the two of you. Only you and Walt can join this call.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:49.325
Once the Popkin wraps up, its direct messages stay, read-only. Nobody can post new

00:01:49.325 --> 00:01:49.950
ones.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:57.225
What no screen shows: a third member cannot read, post to, or join any of it. Asking

00:01:57.225 --> 00:01:59.080
is refused, as not found.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:03.555
Still to come: reactions, replies and photos in a direct message.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.722
That is journey eleven. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
